ize":30268960,"digest":"sha256:1d07010413a4aba089e1acbc0972fed22db17ca1d294157df3e3c03a5bc7b924","download_count":871,"created_at":"2026-10-17T15:31:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:31:24Z"},{"id":650879884,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4my6OM","name":"DBX_0.6.47_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":184084424,"digest":"sha256:9e8b7693cbdb6565819c0eac6db804770f0fec5516743f7671a4e90ecb6291d1","download_count":44,"created_at":"2026-10-17T15:55:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:55:17Z"},{"id":650879883,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4my6OL","name":"DBX_0.6.47_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":118,"digest":"sha256:6806a73fd014b9a6c19d6e4e9eebe7ca4b088a4b22db8374f01352a2507b3ea1","download_count":12,"created_at":"2026-10-17T15:55:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:55:13Z"},{"id":650857782,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4my002","name":"DBX_0.6.47_x64.dmg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":44016562,"digest":"sha256:70ae377746166979a9cee189602525cc454b151a38aed2c418bf8a868a6cb3f2","download_count":60,"created_at":"2026-10-17T15:46:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:46:07Z"},{"id":650823869,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4mysi9","name":"DBX_0.6.47_x64_en-US.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":39235584,"digest":"sha256:bc719344f0d1742728824cf94e48c190895a22a5d16b2df02ed63b107e5f9c8e","download_count":55,"created_at":"2026-10-17T15:31:19Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:31:21Z"},{"id":650857912,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4my024","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":43990994,"digest":"sha256:14f4adbc71a54634a54f583f30f00129a17e6427c8ac50f04c90ba0b63e24f3a","download_count":68,"created_at":"2026-10-17T15:46:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:46:10Z"},{"id":650899746,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4my_Ei","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":18025,"digest":"sha256:644742fdf95bdc4255e77f0f91c84ccd7bcc4807876879f5f452fdd6dd5bbaf2","download_count":8616,"created_at":"2026-10-17T16:03:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T16:03:47Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n\n- Cloudflare D1 和 Turso 连接支持 HTTPS/SOCKS 代理与自定义 CA 证书，代理同时支持显式配置和环境变量 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12534](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12534))\n- 结果网格支持把选中行复制为 SQL DELETE 和 INSERT 语句，便于生成回滚脚本 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12518](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12518))\n- 查询结果导出的文件名来源可配置，支持按结果标签或标签页标题命名 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12525](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12525))\n- OpenCode CLI 提供方支持 OpenCode 2，可自动探测版本或手动指定，不再对 2.x 传入已移除的 --pure 参数 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12546](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12546))\n- 编辑器新增快捷键直接打开连接、数据库和 Schema 选择器（默认 Cmd/Ctrl+Alt+C/D/S，可在设置中自定义） (contributed by @SaifAqqad) (PR [#12538](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12538))\n- 结构对比部署新增出错继续选项，单条语句失败时可选继续执行剩余脚本 (contributed by @Xcylway) (PR [#12545](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12545))\n\n### 改进\n\n- 对象浏览器新增设置，可关闭选中对象时自动打开详情面板 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12559](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12559))\n- 结果标签页新增设置，可关闭点击标签页固定结果的交互 (contributed by @Xcylway) (PR [#12555](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12555))\n- 结果面板底部的 SQL 语句栏支持开关显示 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#12520](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12520))\n- 侧边栏活动连接显示主机和端口，多连接同名时更易区分 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#12536](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12536))\n- 查询标签页改用查询文件图标，与对象浏览器、表数据标签区分更直观 (contributed by @hanxuanyu) (PR [#12471](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12471))\n- 删除行工具栏按钮改用红色危险样式，与不可恢复操作语义一致 (contributed by @yaoxinghuo) (PR [#12535](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12535))\n\n### 修复\n\n- 查询结果中重名列的表头自动加序号区分，SQL 生成、排序和导出仍使用原始列名 (contributed by @Xcylway) (PR [#12548](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12548))\n- 数据生成的时间列严格遵循设定的起止时刻，预览与实际生成一致 (contributed by @Jarvis636431) (PR [#12556](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12556))\n- CSV 导出统计数字有效位数时跨小数点合并计算，接近 Excel 精度上限的长小数不再被误判 (contributed by @Jarvis636431) (PR [#12554](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12554))\n- 网格搜索会检查被显示截断省略的完整单元格内容，命中截断点之后的行不再被过滤隐藏 (contributed by @ericbyz) (PR [#12508](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12508))\n- 外键导航支持跳转到同连接其他数据库的引用表（如 MySQL 跨库外键） (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12505](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12505))\n- 标签页重名序号只按同类型标签计算，查询标签不再与对象浏览器或表数据标签共用编号 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12500](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12500))\n- SQL 格式化不再把无分号分隔的多条语句合并到一行 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#12530](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12530))\n- 默认 DBX 排版遵循换行分号（newlineBeforeSemicolon）设置，分号前的空行样式与所选风格一致 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12499](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12499))\n- MCP 工具的 object 输入模式始终发布 properties 字段，DashScope、DeepSeek 等严格校验的网关不再拒绝工具调用 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12492](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12492))\n- 插件市场源地址含分支 tree 路径时版本链接正确跳转到对应 GitHub Release 页 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12521](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12521))\n- 关闭停靠终端所在标签页时释放对应插件连接，listConnections 可显示工作台标题 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#12544](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12544))\n- 数据传输到 Oracle 系目标时布尔值映射为 NUMBER(1)，不再生成目标不支持的布尔建表类型 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#12491](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12491))\n- openGauss 数据传输到 PostgreSQL 目标时去掉 pg_get_tabledef 附带的压缩等存储参数，建表不再报错 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#12524](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12524))\n- MySQL 查询结果通过只读探测判定数据耗尽，禁用翻到底后的下一页按钮 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#12522](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12522))\n- MySQL 编辑器补全存储过程参数和局部变量 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#12532](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12532))\n- MySQL 图形化编辑索引改为 ALTER TABLE 重建，不再生成不受支持的语句 (contributed by @CN-Scars) (PR [#12498](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12498))\n- Mycat 代理连接可正常列出数据库和表 (contributed by @zhongtait) (PR [#12450](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12450))\n- 达梦表 DDL 和导出包含列注释 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12511](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12511))\n- 达梦自增列表数据编辑不再生成 IDENTITY_INSERT 语句 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12488](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12488))\n- GBase 8s 扩展列类型从 sysxtdtypes 正确解析，不再显示为布尔 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12496](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12496))\n- Firebird 例程和触发器整体作为单个语句处理，正文不再被误拆执行 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12537](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12537))\n- Redis 集群连接遵循配置的连接超时，不再使用驱动默认值 (contributed by @CN-Scars) (PR [#12487](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12487))\n- OceanBase 用户名中的 @ 租户分隔符在界面上原样显示，复制的连接串仍可还原 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#12447](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12447))\n- SQL Server 原生驱动跟随 TDS 路由重定向，路由部署下不再连接失败 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12503](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12503))\n- SQL Server（传统驱动）在新版服务器上读回表和列注释 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#12493](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12493))\n- SQL Server 及更多方言支持在对象树中启用和禁用触发器 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12512](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12512))\n- PostgreSQL 读回列可空性改为直接查 pg_catalog 并正确处理域名类型，不再 join information_schema.columns (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12513](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12513))\n- PostgreSQL 连接中断时日志包含底层 I/O 错误原因，便于定位网络问题 (contributed by @jeff377) (PR [#12502](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12502))\n- 神通数据库复制表时保留表和列注释 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12506](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12506))\n- Vastbase 等驱动返回空结果集向量为 null 时按空处理，UPDATE ... FROM 等操作不再报反序列化错误 (contributed by @Xcylway) (PR [#12547](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12547))\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.47) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.47` 拉取。\n","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":16}
